      "content": "I can help you draft a formal email to your Hausverwaltung. Here's a sample email that you can use as a starting point:\n\nSubject: Request for Inspection of Heating System\n\nDear Hausverwaltung,\n\nI hope this email finds you well. I am writing to bring to your attention a concerning issue with the heating system in my apartment. The radiator has been acting erratically, with periods of high heat followed by prolonged periods of coldness, and I have also been experiencing unusual noises coming from within the walls near the pipes. The scratching and clicking sounds are particularly unsettling, and I am finding it difficult to relax in my apartment due to the uncertainty and potential for further issues.\n\nI understand that the heating system is a complex network of pipes and radiators, but I believe it would be beneficial to have a thorough inspection of the pipes themselves, rather than just checking the thermostat. I would appreciate it if you could arrange for a qualified technician to visit my apartment at your earliest convenience to investigate the issue.\n\nI would like to emphasize that this situation is unusual and I am concerned that it may be a sign of a more serious problem. I am confident that with your attention to this matter, we can resolve the issue and restore the heating",
